    "id": "/lh/en/mobile-app/europe/a-perfect-day-in-frankfurt",
    "items": [
     {
      "type": "mainHeadline",
      "text": "A Perfect Day in Frankfurt",
      "variant": "HEADING_XL",
      "id": "/lh/en/mobile-app/europe/a-perfect-day-in-frankfurt_title",
      "isBold": true
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "<b>9. October 2025 | 2 min read | Julia Buth</b>",
      "size": "SMALL",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/en/mobile-app/europe/a-perfect-day-in-frankfurt_info"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "<b>Julia Buth, a flight attendant at Lufthansa, lived in Frankfurt for a long time and describes her perfect day there.</b>",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/en/mobile-app/europe/a-perfect-day-in-frankfurt_description_0"
     },
     {
      "type": "spacer",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "id": "/lh/en/mobile-app/europe/a-perfect-day-in-frankfurt_separator"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "<b>Morning</b>",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/en/mobile-app/europe/a-perfect-day-in-frankfurt_paragraph_0"
     },
     {
      "type": "image",
      "id": "/content/mobile/lh/en/articles/a-perfect-day-in-frankfurt/jcr:content/articlecontentfragment/par0/image",
      "url": "https://www.lufthansa.com/content/dam/lh/article-images/mobile-app/europe/a-perfect-day-in-frankfurt/lh_app_frankfurt_cafe-karin_1920x1080.jpg.transform/lh-dcep-transform-width-1440/img.jpg",
      "contentDescription": "Various dishes at Café Karin"
     },
     {
      "type": "spacer",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "id": "/content/mobile/lh/en/articles/a-perfect-day-in-frankfurt/jcr:content/articlecontentfragment/par0/separator_copy_copy"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "<b>Breakfast at Café Karin</b>",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/en/mobile-app/europe/a-perfect-day-in-frankfurt_paragraph_1"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "<ul><li>Whether it's bowls, sandwiches, or pancakes, this long-established café prepares every dish with lots of love and regional ingredients</li></ul>",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/en/mobile-app/europe/a-perfect-day-in-frankfurt_paragraph_2"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "Großer Hirschgraben&nbsp;28",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/en/mobile-app/europe/a-perfect-day-in-frankfurt_paragraph_3"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "<b>Goethe's Birthplace</b>",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/en/mobile-app/europe/a-perfect-day-in-frankfurt_paragraph_4"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "<ul><li>Right across from Café Karin, you'll find Goethe's birthplace, which still looks as if the famous poet and his family had just moved out</li><li>My tip is to take a short walk to the Museumsufer Frankfurt</li></ul>",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/en/mobile-app/europe/a-perfect-day-in-frankfurt_paragraph_5"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "Hirschgraben 21",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/en/mobile-app/europe/a-perfect-day-in-frankfurt_paragraph_6"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "<b>Midday</b>",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/en/mobile-app/europe/a-perfect-day-in-frankfurt_paragraph_7"
     },
     {
      "type": "image",
      "id": "/content/mobile/lh/en/articles/a-perfect-day-in-frankfurt/jcr:content/articlecontentfragment/par7/image",
      "url": "https://www.lufthansa.com/content/dam/lh/article-images/mobile-app/europe/a-perfect-day-in-frankfurt/lh_app_frankfurt_staedel-museum_1920x1080.jpg.transform/lh-dcep-transform-width-1440/img.jpg",
      "contentDescription": "People inside the Städel Museum Frankfurt"
     },
     {
      "type": "spacer",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "id": "/content/mobile/lh/en/articles/a-perfect-day-in-frankfurt/jcr:content/articlecontentfragment/par7/separator_copy_copy"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "<b>Städel Museum</b>",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/en/mobile-app/europe/a-perfect-day-in-frankfurt_paragraph_8"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "<ul><li>Whenever I’m in the mood for art, I visit the Städel Museum, where I can explore masterpieces from the past seven centuries.</li><li>For even more culture, head to one of the many museums along the iconic Museumsufer by the Main</li></ul>",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/en/mobile-app/europe/a-perfect-day-in-frankfurt_paragraph_9"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "Schaumainkai 63",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/en/mobile-app/europe/a-perfect-day-in-frankfurt_paragraph_10"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "<b>Chilling at Main Café</b>",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/en/mobile-app/europe/a-perfect-day-in-frankfurt_paragraph_11"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "<ul><li>On summer days, I grab a deck chair at Main Café, watch the crowds of day-trippers, and take in the view of the Frankfurt skyline</li></ul>",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/en/mobile-app/europe/a-perfect-day-in-frankfurt_paragraph_12"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "Schaumainkai 50",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/en/mobile-app/europe/a-perfect-day-in-frankfurt_paragraph_13"
     },
     {
